// ─── Syncthing ignore rules — Story Studio / projects ───────────────────────
//
// Folder ID:  hearthlight-projects
// Windows:    C:\Users\vxi\AppData\Local\hermes\Story Studio\projects
// macOS:      ~/Library/Application Support/hermes/Story Studio/projects
//
// MEASURED 2026-08-05:  311 files, 79 MB syncs.  15 files, 4.31 GB excluded.
//
// WHAT SYNCS:  the live creative work — outlines, bibles, storyboards,
//              generated stills and clips, project identity, and review ledgers. All of yugioh (the v1
//              film) travels, because it is entirely generated with no source.
// WHAT DOES NOT: raw interview media in 00-source/, and the large derived cuts
//              in 01-intake/clips/. Source never changes and is rights-
//              constrained (McConaughey is private use only); a second copy on
//              a laptop is a liability, not a convenience.
//
// Syntax: (?d) = delete if it is the only thing left in a directory.
// Order matters — the first matching line wins.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// ── Raw source media — copy once by hand, never sync ────────────────────────
// 00-source is inputs-only and immutable by convention (hearthlight-conventions).
// Rejoin it manually on any machine that genuinely needs the footage.
00-source/**

// Big cut media derived from source. Regenerable via hearthlight-clip-extractor.
// Remove these three lines if you want to edit clips on the laptop directly.
01-intake/clips/*.mp4
01-intake/clips/*.mov
01-intake/clips/*.wav

// ── Never sync ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
(?d)desktop.ini
(?d)__pycache__
*.pyc
.venv
node_modules

// Editor and OS scratch
*.tmp
*.swp
~$*
.~lock.*

// Syncthing's own conflict copies — resolve them, do not propagate them
*.sync-conflict-*

// ── Everything else syncs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Explicitly: 01-intake transcripts, 02-outline, 03-bible (+ refs), 04-images,
// 05-storyboard, 06-video, 07-final, project.json, 02-outline/FILM-BRIEF.md,
// AGENTS.md, activity-log.md, notion-log.md.
